msgid ""
msgstr "Sphinx is an open-source full-text search server designed with the goal of providing high-performance, low-resource-occupation, and high-relevance search results to applications or websites. Sphinx can easily integrate with SQL databases and scripting languages, providing professional-grade full-text search functionality for various applications. Currently, Sphinx supports mainstream programming languages such as PHP, Python, Perl, Ruby, and Java, and is widely used in many well-known websites and applications as a search solution."

